  "content_id": "16136207",
  "title": "Filecoin FIL Network Fees",
  "description": "Filecoin (FIL) Network – Powering Decentralized Storage\nFilecoin is designed for storing and retrieving data across a decentralized networ...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ6BGCVCTK3GJM52QAW38GA\">Filecoin (FIL) Network – Powering Decentralized Storage</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Filecoin is designed for storing and retrieving data across a decentralized network, but sending FIL tokens works just like sending crypto.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6BGCW7HTSCTFH2K782D82\">How FIL Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Base fee</b> for blockchain transaction</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Priority tip</b> for faster inclusion if needed<br>Fees are paid in <b>FIL tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge Wallet automatically calculates the best fee estimate for you based on current network congestion.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6BGCW74ZV2177HBWBD8M4\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Quickest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced cost and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Save on fees, wait slightly longer</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual control if desired</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6BGCWXDSW0HJGD3YGH45Q\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.05 to $0.20 USD</b> per transaction depending on network activity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6BGCW7QQ823QFVYA1BN58\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Filecoin supports real-world decentralized storage and simple asset transfers. Edge Wallet optimizes FIL fees automatically so your transactions stay affordable and efficient.</p>",
